      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Is this really an issue that you need a Feature for? all you have to do to see if someones on pc or quest is to tap the Menu and see if they have blue or green dot next to their name, this just seems more of a lazy thing really, you cant be asked to hit/tap a button and see witch color the dot is really? Its that hard and to much work for you to do? and why dose it always have to be displayed for? I see people using it as branding more then anything, and people on quest get flank for not owning/using a PC when they are found to be a Quest user, so having it on all the time would be more an issue, not to also point out that it would take more room and GPU to display, sure maybe small but it adds up as a whole.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
